[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD001
TITLE: TOML accept and reject cases
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall load the example airport TOML and expect a parsed airport with its runways, then load an empty file and a runway without a designation and expect both to be rejected before any clearance is issued. Acceptance is those three results, with the valid file producing a runway list and the two invalid files producing an error and no authority.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is the example test for the configuration requirement.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The example file is config/example-airport.toml.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STP001
